Yes — and based on your background, **you should not start with “learn AI” in the traditional sense**.

You already have the difficult part: Azure, ARM, Terraform, GitHub Actions, Azure DevOps, Kubernetes, networking, RBAC, secrets, troubleshooting, etc.

What you need is essentially:

> **DevOps + LLM APIs + automation + agents/tools**

The goal should be to build things like:

```text
GitHub Actions / Azure DevOps
          │
          │ pipeline failure
          ▼
      Error logs
          │
          ▼
